    {
      "id": "environment-contract",
      "type": "page-section",
      "label": "Contract",
      "position": {
        "x": 1700,
        "y": -1526
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 320,
      "data": {
        "title": "Contract",
        "body": "- The `environment` edge class: source a root, target a face, one outgoing and one incoming.\n- The face holds `content` of kind `html`. The box it is drawn in is the graph's window (the root's `data.membrane.bounds`), so its markup sizes itself from that box: `container-type:inline-size` and `cqw`, never `vw`.\n- `data.view.fit` on the face is `screen` (the default) or `window`.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "bridge",
          "updatedAt": 1791592070379,
          "reason": "bridge-reference"
        },
