        "title": "Where this lives",
        "body": "Source (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/graphEnvironment.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/defaultEnvironment.js`\n- `components/NodeGraph/EnvironmentLayer.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/components/pageLinkClick.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/graphEnvironment.test.js`\n- `tests/environmentLinks.test.js`\n- `tests/primitivePosters.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior.",
